<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 403)</h2>
<p><b>Voice notes explained properly, and a proper hello.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The manual now tells the whole voice-notes story with real figures: the timecode-range chip on notes that carry a camera move, playback driving every seat's picture, the long-note scrubber, Record the Session and its badge, and how one review becomes a PDF report (with SESSION MINUTES), SRT subtitles, burned movies, or a session package an artist can replay.</li>
<li>A brand splash at cold launch — Asobi × AUTONOMY — gone in just over a second.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
